{"reviews":[{"id":"B01D9K4HME-0","r":1.0,"t":"Better options at the Dollar Tree","x":"Big ugly chain. Better options at the Dollar Tree.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-1","r":1.0,"t":"these are like what a little kid would get in those little ...","x":"Not worth it, these are like what a little kid would get in those little machines at a pizza parlor. They aren't even close to what they look like in the picture. And though it was extremely cheap I was hoping it would at least be cute, but it just looks extremely tacky.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-2","r":1.0,"t":"Opened the plastic bag and the necklace was already broken ...","x":"Opened the plastic bag and the necklace was already broken... also the metal is cheap looking... I'm a little dissapointed..","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-3","r":4.0,"t":"Very cute and danty for the price.","x":"I have had the necklace for 1 week now and never have taken it off.  I have showered in it and find it still looks new.  I purposedly have done so due to the negative feedback I have read about it.  I must say, it is standing up to normal daily life occurrences quite well.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-4","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap","x":"Super cheap looking! The chain looked like it would break at a stiff breeze, save your money. Luckily I can return at no cost!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-5","r":5.0,"t":"Looks like good quality","x":"It feels cheaply made of course the price is so small but it doesn't look it and that's all the matters to me. Very unique. Love it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-6","r":1.0,"t":"Very disappointed","x":"Complete waste of money. Very disappointed in this product. I could have gotten the same quality out of a gumball machine.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-7","r":1.0,"t":"Cheap","x":"If it\u2019s cheap there\u2019s a reason! Should have known better but still ordered it. Looks super cheap. Will never wear it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-8","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"The chain looks cheap.  For the price I had to pay, I suppose it is.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-9","r":1.0,"t":"Easily broken","x":"Cute necklace,  but it broke after only wearing it one time.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-10","r":4.0,"t":"About as expected","x":"This is a cute piece of cheap jewelry. No, it doesn't look like it came from Tiffany. Yes, the bottom 2 chains cross during the day wearing it (as you can see in the picture). I'm thinking of finding a heavier charm to pull the middle chain down lower to solve that problem. It's still cute, and worth the price to me.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-11","r":4.0,"t":"so for the price I'm fine with that","x":"Very cute for the price. I know this will probably tarnish over the next year, but I don't mind because it's a trendy look and will probably be out of style by the time it does tarnish, so for the price I'm fine with that.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-12","r":5.0,"t":"This is a great item to purchase online","x":"This is a great item to purchase online! I wore it once and received so many compliments. It looks great with low cut shirts. It\u2019s a very shiny finish so if you want some subtle pop of a style, this necklace is for you!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-13","r":3.0,"t":"Tangles up too easy","x":"Looks nice but I totally agree the chains cross over each other even when you think they are on straight. Kind of bizarre. Would not buy again but it was cheap enough so no real loss.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-14","r":1.0,"t":"Nice necklace, but cheaply built.","x":"This necklace was cheap but it really was cheaply built as well.  You get what you pay for.  The photos looked nicer than the appearance in real life....in my opinion.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-15","r":1.0,"t":"very disappointed!","x":"It is very cheap looking..I guess given the price, I can't complain, but it's not even worth that!  Looks very cheap compared to the pictures, very disappointed!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-16","r":3.0,"t":"I ordered this in gold, but received the silver ...","x":"I ordered this in gold, but received the silver. It's cute, but gets tangled in everything from my hair to my clothes to my scarf to itself.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-17","r":1.0,"t":"Shines too much","x":"I thought it was discrete  as it appears in the picture but it has a very silver-false looking and it shines too much. Haven't even used it.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-18","r":3.0,"t":"Pretty well made for the price","x":"Pretty well made for the price! But the necklace is very &#34;SILVER&#34; kind of cheap looking in my opinion. But for the price not bad","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-19","r":1.0,"t":"You get what you pay for - this was very ...","x":"You get what you pay for - this was very cheap and I will be giving to my 3 year old niece as &#34;play jewelry&#34;","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-20","r":5.0,"t":"Very beautiful","x":"Homy cow this thing shines! Another gift for my daughter. She loves silver jewelry and this necklace is perfect!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-21","r":1.0,"t":"Dont do it","x":"A lot chunckier with the chain. Also it stay separated for one second and then it gets all tangled up again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-22","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"This necklace was nice out of the package but tarnished after 2 wears. Not worth the money","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-23","r":5.0,"t":"Good fit","x":"Loved it, and looked perfect with my outfit.  Looks good when you have your neck esposed.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01D9K4HME-24","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"poor quality, sent message to seller and got no reply. Necklace broke at latch first use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the necklace looks cheap or tacky in person, often worse than the photos suggest.","cites":[2,3,5,7,8,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the necklace broke or seemed flimsy, including one that arrived already broken.","cites":[3,5,10]},{"text":"Some reviewers find it cute and good value for the low price, with a few noting it held up well to daily wear.","cites":[4,6,11,12,13]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers note the chains cross or tangle easily during wear.","cites":[11,14]}]},"qa":[]}